<title>EGYPT: UAE woman dies in Cairo Ferris wheel accident.</title>
<headline>UAE woman dies in Cairo Ferris wheel accident.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A woman from the United Arab Emirates was killed and her two children and her sister were injured on Sunday when the Ferris wheel at a Cairo amusement park fell to the ground, security sources said.</p>
<p>They said 24-year-old Aseela Jasem died after the wheel became dislodged. Her children Ahmed and Reem and her sister Sara were injured.</p>
